WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:01,310
Boss Xia, that’s okay

2
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:05,110
Hello everyone, I am the boss Xia of the Holiday Ice Hall.

3
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:08,110
I came to the third base this time to tell you some good news.

4
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:10,110
The resort ice pavilion has opened its restaurant to the public

5
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:13,110
It's open all day, from 8 a.m. to 6 p.m.

6
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:16,110
Steamed buns, dumplings, soy milk, milk, rice bowl and noodles should be added.

7
00:00:16,110 --> 00:00:18,110
As long as you have a gold box in your hand, you are welcome to apply for a points card in our store

8
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:20,110
One point can be exchanged for 100 points

9
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:22,110
And such a lunch box

10
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:25,110
Just like this, a whole box of barbecue lunch only costs fifteen points.

11
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:29,110
Let’s do some math, how many boxes of lunch can you buy with 100 points? Six boxes can be bought.

12
00:00:29,110 --> 00:00:32,110
How can the lunch boxes sold to us be so cheap?

13
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:34,110
And is that ice house real?

14
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:36,110
Is there really such a paradise in the world?

15
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:39,110
Moreover, our store not only has enough food, but also provides water for everyone

16
00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:40,110
clean water without impurities

17
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:43,110
You can buy a bottle of mineral water like this with just two points
